[0.082257, "o", "\r\n==================================================================\r\n  OSM on Logos — end-to-end demo\r\n==================================================================\r\n\r\nRISC0_DEV_MODE = 0   (REAL Groth16 proofs — each registration takes a few minutes)\r\n\r\nPart 1 (on-chain):  deploy -> Init -> 3 registrars x germany (versions\r\n                    advancing) -> batch{france,us/california,kenya}\r\nPart 2 (off-chain): discover(72) -> host+MD5-verify -> store -> fetch\r\n                    -> re-verify -> import -> update-check -> tamper\r\n                    reject, against a REAL Codex storage node.\r\n"]
